NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers THIS IMPLEMENTATION only. The F-SAT method, the
DeepFakeVox-HQ dataset and all results described in the paper below are the
work of its authors and are not covered by this licence:

  Zirui Zhang, Wei Hao, Aroon Sankoh, William Lin, Emanuel Mendiola-Ortiz,
  Junfeng Yang, Chengzhi Mao. "I Can Hear You: Selective Robust Training for
  Deepfake Audio Detection." ICLR 2025. arXiv:2411.00121.

This is an UNOFFICIAL reimplementation written from the paper text. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or reviewed by those authors, who released no
reference implementation.

The RawNet3 architecture is due to Jung et al., arXiv:2203.08488, and is
reimplemented here from that paper's description.

ASVspoof2019 is distributed under its own licence by its organisers and is not
included in this repository.
